          ],
          "content": "Chapter 13 — Our Home: Earth, a Unique Life Sustaining Planet"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.896,
            0.038,
            0.933,
            0.053
          ],
          "content": "213"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.083,
            0.745,
            0.16
          ],
          "content": "Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune. Out of all these planets, Mercury, Venus, Earth, and Mars, are relatively small and rocky planets, while Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune are large planets, mostly made of gases."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.161,
            0.744,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": "Let us find out more about the planets in the solar system by performing Activity 13.2."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.211,
            0.503,
            0.236
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 13.2: Let us find out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.245,
            0.745,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": "z Collect information about the temperature and size of the planets in the solar system, and check if they have an atmosphere."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.305,
            0.743,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "You may collect this information from books in your school library, trusted websites, or discuss with your teachers."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.345,
            0.603,
            0.365
          ],
          "content": "Fill out the missing information in Table 13.2."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.402,
            0.802,
            0.715
          ],
          "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" colspan=\"5\">S.No. Planet temAvp (eeor<sub>C</sub>raa)gteure co tmhReapda Eiaruersdt,h to atmHoassp ahnere?</td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td>1.</td><td>Mercury</td><td>170</td><td></td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Venus</td><td>450</td><td>0.95</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td>Earth</td><td>15</td><td>1</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>5.</td><td></td><td></td><td>11</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>6.</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>7.</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>8.</td><td></td><td>-200</td><td>4</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
